WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A race, in miniature.
Launch straight into Suzuka. 17 moving streams. Recorded, not simulated.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Find your angle.
Overview. Follow. Battle. Orbit the circuit, then reset your camera.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Hold the moment.
Pause, scrub and resume. Replay the field at your own pace.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Change the pace.
Native speed sheets. Choose 0.25x through 4x playback.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Read the race.
Recorded gaps and intervals. Select a driver to return to the miniature.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Compare the details.
Choose two drivers. Seek from their time-aligned speed traces.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Inspect the telemetry.
Speed, throttle, brake, gear and RPM. Source age stays visible beside the numbers.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.750
Show the limits, too.
Illustrative lanes. Approximate positioning. The reconstruction says what it can prove.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:17.750
Every driver counts.
Tap grouped projections to cycle selection. System appearance adapts from light to dark.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:29.667
Back to the field.
One replay. Three perspectives. Built by Pratik Rai.

